LLaVA, LLaVA-NeXT, VLM-3R, and training utilities
----------------------------------------------
The llava/ package builds on LLaVA, LLaVA-NeXT, and VLM-3R and has been
modified for VLM2's spatial encoder, dual memory, training, and model loading.
These upstream projects provide their relevant code under Apache License 2.0.
